WEBVTT

00:00:01.797 --> 00:00:03.132
(LUCA PANTING)

00:00:04.258 --> 00:00:07.345
Bravo, Luca. That was your fastest yet.

00:00:07.428 --> 00:00:08.888
-(TRAIN HORN TOOTING)
-Ooh, guys, look!

00:00:09.222 --> 00:00:10.681
That's the train to Genova.

00:00:10.765 --> 00:00:12.058
LUCA: That goes to your school?

00:00:12.141 --> 00:00:13.142
-Yeah.
-(ALBERTO SCOFFS)

00:00:13.226 --> 00:00:14.852
I was wondering, actually,

00:00:14.936 --> 00:00:17.563
is your school open to everyone?

00:00:17.647 --> 00:00:20.483
Well, it costs a little money,
but I guess.

00:00:20.566 --> 00:00:21.901
Great. Thank you, Giulia,

00:00:21.984 --> 00:00:23.611
for showing us the boring thing

00:00:23.694 --> 00:00:25.238
that takes us to the terrible place.

00:00:25.321 --> 00:00:27.198
Now, can we focus on what matters?

00:00:27.281 --> 00:00:30.076
If we lose this race,
we're not going anywhere.

00:00:30.284 --> 00:00:32.829
Santa mozzarella. The downhill.

00:00:32.912 --> 00:00:33.913
I know it looks scary.

00:00:33.996 --> 00:00:34.997
But here's what you need to know...

00:00:35.081 --> 00:00:36.207
Would you stop bossing him around?

00:00:36.290 --> 00:00:37.291
What is your problem?

00:00:37.375 --> 00:00:39.502
I'm his friend. I know what he needs.

00:00:39.585 --> 00:00:41.170
Oh, yeah?
Well, then, what does he need?

00:00:41.254 --> 00:00:43.965
Me. We'll just ride it
like we did on the island. Together.

00:00:44.715 --> 00:00:45.883
-Andiamo.
-No!

00:00:46.342 --> 00:00:47.552
Alberto, stop!

00:00:47.635 --> 00:00:48.970
That's Bruno talking!

00:00:49.053 --> 00:00:51.639
LUCA: No! I'm pretty sure that's just me!

00:00:51.722 --> 00:00:53.516
-(CAT YOWLS)
-(LUCA YELPING)

00:00:55.059 --> 00:00:56.477
(EXCLAIMS IN ITALIAN)

00:00:56.978 --> 00:00:58.312
-Stop, Alberto!
-Let it go!

00:00:58.396 --> 00:00:59.397
LUCA: Look out!

00:00:59.480 --> 00:01:00.773
(ALL GASP)

00:01:02.233 --> 00:01:03.526
(BOTH SCREAMING)

00:01:06.154 --> 00:01:08.656
(GASPS) Porca paletta, what was that?

00:01:08.739 --> 00:01:09.740
CICCIO: Huh?

00:01:09.824 --> 00:01:12.410
Bah! Not now, Ciccio! Eyes on the water!

00:01:12.493 --> 00:01:13.995
-Move, move!
-Okay.

00:01:15.454 --> 00:01:16.455
(GASPS)

00:01:17.165 --> 00:01:19.917
GIULIA: (MUFFLED) Oh, no!
Luca! Alberto!

00:01:20.418 --> 00:01:22.086
She'll see us. Come on!

00:01:26.799 --> 00:01:29.093
Look, I was just trying to
show you how to do it right.

00:01:29.177 --> 00:01:30.720
You don't know how to do it right!

00:01:30.803 --> 00:01:32.138
I got us down the hill, didn't I?

00:01:32.221 --> 00:01:34.307
You crashed! Into the sea!

00:01:34.390 --> 00:01:35.475
ALBERTO: It's fine.

00:01:35.558 --> 00:01:38.227
Nothing's fine! My parents just saw me!

00:01:38.311 --> 00:01:39.729
Luca, your parents aren't here.

00:01:39.812 --> 00:01:41.397
You don't know what you're talking about!

00:01:41.481 --> 00:01:43.316
Look, this town is making you crazy.

00:01:43.399 --> 00:01:45.943
We just need to win that Vespa
and get outta here.

00:01:46.402 --> 00:01:48.362
It's not gonna be any different.

00:01:48.696 --> 00:01:50.031
I don't wanna...

00:01:51.073 --> 00:01:52.366
(BREATHES DEEPLY)

00:01:53.159 --> 00:01:54.660
I wanna go to school.

00:01:54.827 --> 00:01:57.205
That again? We can't go to school.

00:01:57.288 --> 00:01:58.664
You're just afraid you can't do it.

00:01:58.748 --> 00:02:00.208
(SCOFFS) I'm not afraid.

00:02:00.291 --> 00:02:01.542
You're the one who gets afraid.

00:02:01.626 --> 00:02:02.919
(GRUNTS) Shut up!

00:02:03.002 --> 00:02:04.378
(BOTH GRUNTING)

00:02:05.421 --> 00:02:06.422
-(CHOMPS)
-Ow!

00:02:06.506 --> 00:02:07.673
(BOTH GRUNTING)

00:02:07.757 --> 00:02:09.217
What happens when she sees you?

00:02:09.300 --> 00:02:10.301
When anyone sees you?

00:02:10.384 --> 00:02:11.719
Get off me! (GRUNTS)

00:02:11.802 --> 00:02:13.721
GIULIA: (GASPS) You're alive!

00:02:16.015 --> 00:02:17.099
(GIULIA SIGHS)

00:02:17.683 --> 00:02:20.061
Hey! You're never allowed
on my bike again.

00:02:20.144 --> 00:02:21.813
(SIGHS) Stick to food, big guy.

00:02:21.896 --> 00:02:22.897
(GROWLS)

00:02:24.524 --> 00:02:26.651
Uh, what's going on?

00:02:26.734 --> 00:02:28.027
Nothing. Let's just get back to training.

00:02:28.110 --> 00:02:30.363
Actually, we have something to ask you.

00:02:30.446 --> 00:02:31.572
We were wondering

00:02:31.656 --> 00:02:33.616
if we could come with you to your school?

00:02:34.450 --> 00:02:37.745
Santo pecorino! That's the best idea ever!

00:02:37.829 --> 00:02:40.081
Yes! Of course! (LAUGHS EXCITEDLY)

00:02:40.998 --> 00:02:43.292
(GREETS IN ITALIAN)

00:02:43.376 --> 00:02:44.377
(BOTH LAUGH)

00:02:44.460 --> 00:02:46.379
Uh, Giulia, your school,

00:02:46.462 --> 00:02:48.422
does it take all kinds of people?

00:02:48.881 --> 00:02:51.217
I mean, what if some of them
were not human?

00:02:51.300 --> 00:02:52.385
Alberto...

00:02:52.468 --> 00:02:56.055
What if some were, oh,
I don't know, sea monsters?

00:02:56.138 --> 00:02:57.139
Sea monsters?

00:02:57.223 --> 00:03:00.226
I doubt your school would even
accept sea monsters, right?

00:03:00.309 --> 00:03:01.352
(LAUGHS NERVOUSLY)

00:03:01.435 --> 00:03:03.187
Ah, that's a weird joke, Alberto.

00:03:03.271 --> 00:03:05.106
Yeah, I know, it's kinda hard to imagine.

00:03:05.189 --> 00:03:06.357
So, let me just show you!

00:03:06.440 --> 00:03:07.608
-No!
-(GRUNTS)

00:03:07.692 --> 00:03:08.693
(GASPS)

00:03:08.776 --> 00:03:10.403
-(SIGHS) Come on.
-Giulia, wait!

00:03:10.486 --> 00:03:12.238
We don't have time to goof around.

00:03:12.321 --> 00:03:14.031
Huh? (WHIMPERING)

00:03:17.577 --> 00:03:19.453
(GIULIA CONTINUES WHIMPERING)

00:03:19.537 --> 00:03:20.538
Help!

00:03:20.997 --> 00:03:22.165
Don't hurt us!

00:03:22.248 --> 00:03:23.875
-See? I knew this would...
-Sea monster!

00:03:24.083 --> 00:03:25.084
(GASPS)

00:03:25.168 --> 00:03:26.794
Did you hear that? This way.

00:03:26.878 --> 00:03:28.629
-(BREATHING HEAVILY)
-Luca?

00:03:31.048 --> 00:03:32.216
Stay back!

00:03:33.176 --> 00:03:35.553
Sea monster! There it is!

00:03:39.849 --> 00:03:41.476
Ragazzi, now!

00:03:41.559 --> 00:03:42.560
No!

00:03:47.940 --> 00:03:50.109
Ah, idioti, you let it get away!

00:03:50.193 --> 00:03:51.194
To the boat!

00:03:51.277 --> 00:03:52.820
We're gonna kill a sea monster!

00:03:58.743 --> 00:04:00.953
(OPERATIC MUSIC PLAYING SOFTLY OVER RADIO)

00:04:04.457 --> 00:04:05.833
-(MACHIAVELLI GRUMBLES)
-(GASPS)

00:04:05.917 --> 00:04:06.918
(DOOR OPENS)

00:04:07.001 --> 00:04:10.171
Oh, there you are. I made your favorite,

00:04:10.254 --> 00:04:11.714
trenette al pesto.

00:04:12.423 --> 00:04:13.758
Where's Alberto?

00:04:14.008 --> 00:04:16.802
Uh, he left, Signor Marcovaldo.

00:04:21.182 --> 00:04:22.725
Do you know where he went?

00:04:22.809 --> 00:04:24.769
No. But I don't think

00:04:24.852 --> 00:04:26.312
he wants anyone looking for him.

00:04:26.687 --> 00:04:29.023
Maybe not. But just in case.

00:04:30.983 --> 00:04:32.068
(DOOR CLOSES)

00:04:32.819 --> 00:04:33.861
Okay.

00:04:33.945 --> 00:04:35.154
Well, the two of us can still do the race.

00:04:35.780 --> 00:04:38.199
You'll swim, you'll eat,
you've done both before...

00:04:38.282 --> 00:04:39.700
-Luca, I...
-...and I'll do the ride.

00:04:39.784 --> 00:04:41.202
I mean, that's allowed, right?

00:04:41.285 --> 00:04:42.870
-Luca. Luca?
-It should be fine,

00:04:42.954 --> 00:04:44.247
-we're still okay...
-Luca!

00:04:44.330 --> 00:04:45.331
(YELPS)

00:04:48.000 --> 00:04:50.461
(SIGHS) Sleeping under the fish.
Now I get it.

00:04:50.545 --> 00:04:51.587
Uh, I can explain.

00:04:51.671 --> 00:04:54.382
Of all the places
for sea monsters to visit,

00:04:54.465 --> 00:04:55.758
Portorosso?

00:04:55.842 --> 00:04:57.468
Have you seen this town?

00:04:57.552 --> 00:04:59.971
My father hunts sea monsters!

00:05:00.346 --> 00:05:02.139
Luca, you have to get out of here.

00:05:02.223 --> 00:05:04.433
But I thought we were underdogs.

00:05:04.725 --> 00:05:07.270
Do you think I want you to leave?

00:05:07.353 --> 00:05:09.981
This is the happiest I've...
(INHALES DEEPLY)

00:05:10.064 --> 00:05:11.941
Look, it's just not worth it.

00:05:12.024 --> 00:05:13.734
You don't understand.

00:05:13.818 --> 00:05:15.528
No, I don't.

00:05:15.611 --> 00:05:18.239
Risking your life for a Vespa?

00:05:18.573 --> 00:05:20.449
My parents were gonna send me away.

00:05:21.868 --> 00:05:24.287
That's why we did all of this.

00:05:27.165 --> 00:05:29.167
But it's over now.

00:05:31.544 --> 00:05:32.628
(SIGHS)

00:05:33.337 --> 00:05:34.922
Goodbye, Giulia.

00:05:35.423 --> 00:05:36.757
I'm sorry.

00:05:37.717 --> 00:05:38.885
(SIGHS)

00:05:40.136 --> 00:05:42.471
(MELANCHOLY ORCHESTRAL MUSIC PLAYING)

